sequenceDiagram
    title Checkout
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant API as Checkout API
    participant P as Payments
    U->>+API: POST /checkout
    API->>P: Authorise card
    alt card ok
        P-->>API: 200 authorised
    else declined
        P-->>API: 402
        API-->>U: Payment failed
    end
    loop every 5s
        API->>API: poll status
    end
    Note over API,P: idempotency key per order
    API-->>-U: 201 Created
